# Test directory

Run from the repository root. See [TESTING.md](../TESTING.md) for the complete
eight-suite Node sequence, three browser scripts, prerequisites, generated report
files, and limits of each harness. [BENCHMARKS.md](../BENCHMARKS.md) separates
current dated observations from historical reports. Original `cases.json` and
the tracked `full-spectrum-results.json` are preserved rather than silently
replaced by a local rerun.
